ription":"American teacher and former businessman who met Ramesh Balsekar in 1987, published his books, and teaches non-doership through the Advaita Fellowship.","birthDate":"1951","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/inchegeri"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/sri-ranjit-maharaj","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/sri-ranjit-maharaj","name":"Sri Ranjit Maharaj","alternateName":"Ranjit Maharaj","description":"Fellow disciple of Siddharameshwar Maharaj alongside Nisargadatta, who taught in Bombay and in Europe late in life that everything is illusion and only the Self is real.","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q18207386"],"birthDate":"1913","deathDate":"2000","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/inchegeri"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/stephen-wolinsky","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/stephen-wolinsky","name":"Stephen Wolinsky","alternateName":"Stephen Wolinsky","description":"American psychologist and writer who sat with Nisargadatta Maharaj in 1979–81 and later made the film Rays of the Absolute about his legacy.","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q125628687"],"knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/inchegeri"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/s-k-mullarpattan","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/s-k-mullarpattan","name":"S. K. Mullarpattan","alternateName":"Mullarpattan","description":"One of the main interpreters at Nisargadatta Maharaj's Bombay talks, interviewed in Rays of the Absolute.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/inchegeri"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/vanaja-narayanswamy","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/vanaja-narayanswamy","name":"Dr. Vanaja Narayanswamy","alternateName":"Vanaja Narayanswamy","description":"Disciple of Nisargadatta Maharaj interviewed in Rays of the Absolute.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/inchegeri"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/jean-dunn","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/jean-dunn","name":"Jean Dunn","alternateName":"Jean Dunn","description":"American disciple of Nisargadatta Maharaj who recorded and edited his last talks into three books.","birthDate":"1921","deathDate":"1996","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/inchegeri"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/atmananda-blanca-schlamm","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/atmananda-blanca-schlamm","name":"Atmananda (Blanca Schlamm)","alternateName":"Atmananda","description":"Austrian-born pianist who lived with Anandamayi Ma for decades as a brahmacharini and translated her sayings into English; interviewed in 1981.","birthDate":"1904","deathDate":"1985","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/anandamayi-sangha"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/swami-chidananda-saraswati","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/swami-chidananda-saraswati","name":"Swami Chidananda","alternateName":"Swami Chidananda","description":"Successor of Swami Sivananda as president of the Divine Life Society in Rishikesh and a close friend of Anandamayi Ma.","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q173262"],"birthDate":"1916","deathDate":"2008","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/divine-life-society"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/swami-kedarnath","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/swami-kedarnath","name":"Swami Kedarnath","alternateName":"Swami Kedarnath","description":"Monk of Sri Sri Mata Anandamayi Peeth, Indore, who explains Anandamayi Ma's teaching in English.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/anandamayi-sangha"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/swami-vijayananda","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/swami-vijayananda","name":"Swami Vijayananda","alternateName":"Swami Vijayananda","description":"French physician