a","name":"Guruji Amritananda Natha Saraswati","description":"Nuclear physicist (Dr Nishtala Prahlada Sastry, 23 years at TIFR Mumbai) who became a Śrī Vidyā guru and founded the Devipuram temple near Visakhapatnam, known for opening Śrī Vidyā initiation and Śrī Chakra worship to all.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/sri-vidya"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/andre-padoux","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/andre-padoux","name":"André Padoux","description":"French diplomat turned CNRS scholar of tantric mantra and speech (Vāc); read Abhinavagupta with Lakshmanjoo in Srinagar in 1958–59.","birthDate":"1920","deathDate":"2017","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/tantra-studies"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/anya-foxen","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/anya-foxen","name":"Anya Foxen","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/hatha"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/ben-williams","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/ben-williams","name":"Ben Williams","description":"Scholar-practitioner of Śaiva tantra and Abhinavagupta; frequent guest on yoga-studies podcasts.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/bettina-baumer","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/bettina-baumer","name":"Bettina Sharada Bäumer","description":"Austrian-born Indologist living in Varanasi; a student of Swami Lakshmanjoo who lectures on the Vijñāna Bhairava, Śiva Sūtras, Spanda and Netra Tantra and on Abhinavagupta's aesthetics.","birthDate":"1940","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/bjarne-wernicke-olesen","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/bjarne-wernicke-olesen","name":"Bjarne Wernicke-Olesen","description":"Danish scholar of Śākta and Kubjikā traditions.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kaula"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/bodhinatha-veylanswami","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/bodhinatha-veylanswami","name":"Satguru Bodhinatha Veylanswami","description":"Head of Kauai's Hindu Monastery (Kauai Aadheenam) and publisher of Hinduism Today; successor of Sivaya Subramuniyaswami in the Nandinatha Sampradaya, teaching a monistic Śaiva Siddhānta.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/shaiva-siddhanta"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/christopher-tompkins","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/christopher-tompkins","name":"Christopher Tompkins","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kaula"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/csaba-kiss","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/csaba-kiss","name":"Csaba Kiss","description":"Budapest (ELTE) Indologist; Oxford doctorate on the Matsyendrasaṃhitā, editor of Brahmayāmala volume II.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kaula"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/daniel-odier","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/daniel-odier","name":"Daniel Odier","description":"French writer and teacher of Kashmiri Tantra (Spanda, Kālī practice, Tāṇḍava) and Chan; many uploads are in French, only English ones are kept.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/daniela-bevilacqua","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/daniela-bevilacqua","name":"Daniela Bevilacqua","description":"Ethnographer of Hindu ascetics on the Haṭha Yoga Project.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/hatha"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/david-gordon-white","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/david-gordon-white","name":"David Gordon White","description":"UCSB historian of religions (PhD Chicago 1988) known for The Alchemical Body, Kiss of the Yoginī and Sinister Yogis.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/siddha-siddhanta"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/debra-diamond","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/debra-diamond","name":"Debra Diamond","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kaula"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/diwakar-acharya","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/diwakar-acharya","name":"Diwakar Acharya","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/pashupata"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/dominic-goodall","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/dominic-goodall","name":"Dominic Goodall","description":"Sanskritist at the École française d'Extrême-Orient (head of its Pondicherry centre 2002–2011); editor of early Śaiva Siddhānta texts such as the Kiraṇavṛtti and the Niśvāsatattvasaṃhitā.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/shaiva-siddhanta"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/douglas-brooks","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/douglas-brooks","name":"Douglas Brooks","description":"Professor of religion at the University of Rochester (PhD Harvard) and founder of the Rajanaka teaching, rooted in South Indian Śrī Vidyā as learned from his teacher Gopala Aiyar Sundaramoorthy.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/sri-vidya"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/edwin-bryant","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/edwin-bryant","name":"Edwin Bryant","description":"Rutgers scholar of the Yoga Sūtras and Bhāgavata Purāṇa.","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q4095737"],"knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/hatha"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/elizabeth-de-michelis","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/elizabeth-de-michelis","name":"Elizabeth De Michelis","description":"Cambridge scholar of modern yoga (A History of Modern Yoga); supervised Mark Singleton.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/hatha"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"},"knows":[{"@type":"Role","roleName":"academic_supervisor_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/mark-singleton"}}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/eric-baret","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/eric-baret","name":"Éric Baret","description":"French teacher in the line of Jean Klein who presents Kashmir Shaivism as a non-dual, body-based listening.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/gavin-flood","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/gavin-flood","name":"Gavin Flood","description":"Oxford scholar of Hinduism and comparative religion; author of The Tantric Body and studies of the Netra Tantra and Śaiva theology.","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q4490975"],"birthDate":"1954","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/gopala-aiyar-sundaramoorthy","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/gopala-aiyar-sundaramoorthy","name":"Gopala Aiyar Sundaramoorthy (\"Appa\")","description":"Sanskrit professor at Madurai-Kamaraj University and teacher of Douglas Brooks; source of the Rajanaka teaching.","birthDate":"1936","deathDate":"1994","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/sri-vidya"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"},"knows":[{"@type":"Role","roleName":"teacher_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/douglas-brooks"}}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/gorakhnath","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/gorakhnath","name":"Gorakhnāth (Gorakṣanātha)","alternateName":"Goraksha","description":"Founder-figure of the Nāth yogīs, credited with haṭha texts such as the Amaraugha.","birthDate":"0011","deathDate":"0012","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/siddha-siddhanta"}],"knows":[{"@type":"Role","roleName":"influenced","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/gorakhnath-math-gorakhpur"}}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/harunaga-isaacson","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/harunaga-isaacson","name":"Harunaga Isaacson","description":"Professor of Classical Indology at Hamburg, specialist in Indian Vajrayāna Buddhism and its links with tantric Śaivism.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/vajrayana"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"},"knows":[{"@type":"Role","roleName":"academic_supervisor_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/shaman-hatley"}}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/igor-kufayev","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/igor-kufayev","name":"Igor Kufayev","description":"Russian-born, Europe-based teacher whose darshans and courses draw heavily on Kashmir Shaivism (Trika, Krama, Spanda) and on kundalini as the process of awakening.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/jaideva-singh","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/jaideva-singh","name":"Jaideva Singh","description":"Indian scholar whose English translations of the Pratyabhijñāhṛdayam, Śiva Sūtras, Spanda Kārikās and Vijñāna Bhairava made Kashmir Shaivism widely readable; worked closely with Lakshmanjoo.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/james-mallinson","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/james-mallinson","name":"James Mallinson","description":"Boden Professor of Sanskrit at Oxford and leader of the Haṭha Yoga Project; edited the Khecarīvidyā, Dattātreyayogaśāstra and Amṛtasiddhi; also an initiated Rāmānandī mahant.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/hatha"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/jason-birch","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/jason-birch","name":"Jason Birch","description":"Historian of medieval yoga on the Haṭha Yoga Project; editor of the Amanaska, Amaraugha and Yogacintāmaṇi.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/hatha"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/judit-torzsok","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/judit-torzsok","name":"Judit Törzsök","description":"Professor of Śaiva Studies at the EPHE, Paris; works on early Śākta tantras such as the Siddhayogeśvarīmata and on yoginī cults.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kaula"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/june-mcdaniel","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/june-mcdaniel","name":"June McDaniel","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/shakta"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/kavitha-chinnaiyan","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/kavitha-chinnaiyan","name":"Kavitha Chinnaiyan","description":"Cardiologist and teacher of Śrī Vidyā and Advaita (Svatantra Institute).","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/sri-vidya"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/lakulisha","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/lakulisha","name":"Lakulīśa","description":"Traditional founder of the Pāśupata ascetic order, the earliest named Śaiva movement (Atimārga).","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/pashupata"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/lilian-silburn","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/lilian-silburn","name":"Lilian Silburn","description":"French CNRS Indologist who studied Trika with Lakshmanjoo from 1949 and published French translations of the Vijñāna Bhairava, Śiva Sūtras and (with Padoux) the Tantrāloka.","birthDate":"1908","deathDate":"1993","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"},"knows":[{"@type":"Role","roleName":"influenced","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/andre-padoux"}}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/loriliai-biernacki","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/loriliai-biernacki","name":"Loriliai Biernacki","description":"Scholar of Hindu tantra (University of Colorado Boulder) writing on women in tantra, Abhinavagupta, wonder and new materialism.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/lorin-roche","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/lorin-roche","name":"Lorin Roche","description":"Meditation teacher known for The Radiance Sutras, a free poetic rendering of the Vijñāna Bhairava.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/louis-renou","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/louis-renou","name":"Louis Renou","description":"French Vedic scholar who directed Lilian Silburn's thesis and taught André Padoux Sanskrit.","birthDate":"1896","deathDate":"1966","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/tantra-studies"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"},"knows":[{"@type":"Role","roleName":"academic_supervisor_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/lilian-silburn"}},{"@type":"Role","roleName":"influenced","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/andre-padoux"}}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/mark-dyczkowski","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/mark-dyczkowski","name":"Mark Dyczkowski","description":"English Indologist and sitarist who lived four decades in Varanasi; initiated by Lakshmanjoo in 1976; translator of the Spanda texts, the Manthānabhairava Tantra and the 11-volume Tantrāloka. Died in Varanasi on 2 February 2025. Since April 2026 his students Arjun Seernels and Brian Campbell lead the Anuttara Trika Kula Reading Circles.","birthDate":"1951","deathDate":"2025","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/trika"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"},"knows":[{"@type":"Role","roleName":"teacher_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/arjun-seernels"}},{"@type":"Role","roleName":"teacher_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/brian-campbell"}}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/mark-singleton","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/mark-singleton","name":"Mark Singleton","description":"Scholar of modern and premodern yoga (Yoga Body, Roots of Yoga with Mallinson); senior researcher on the Haṭha Yoga Project.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/hatha"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/mary-reilly-nichols","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/mary-reilly-nichols","name":"Mary Reilly Nichols","description":"Yoga and meditation teacher formed in Siddha Yoga who teaches Kashmir Shaivism.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/matsyendranatha","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/matsyendranatha","name":"Matsyendranātha","description":"Legendary founder of the Kaula yoginī cult and first guru of the Nāth lineage.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kaula"}],"knows":[{"@type":"Role","roleName":"teacher_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/gorakhnath"}}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/om-swami","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/om-swami","name":"Om Swami","description":"Indian monk and author who teaches mantra sādhana and Śrī Vidyā; many talks are in Hindi, so only English uploads were kept.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/sri-vidya"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/paul-muller-ortega","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/paul-muller-ortega","name":"Paul Muller-Ortega","description":"Scholar of Indian religions (PhD, University of California) who taught at Michigan State and Rochester for 25 years, then founded Blue Throat Yoga (2006) to teach Neelakantha Meditation from the Śaiva–Śākta tradition of Kashmir.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/rajarshi-nandy","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/rajarshi-nandy","name":"Rajarshi Nandy","description":"Indian upāsaka of Bhairava, Kālī and Kāmākhyā who founded the Kamakhya Bhairava Upasaka Foundation (KBUF); speaks in English, sometimes mixed with Hindi, on Shākta sādhana.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/shakta"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/rajmani-tigunait","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/rajmani-tigunait","name":"Pandit Rajmani Tigunait","description":"Spiritual head of the Himalayan Institute and successor of Swami Rama; Sanskritist who teaches Śrī Vidyā, the Śrī Sūkta and tantric mantra practice.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/sri-vidya"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/richard-gombrich","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/richard-gombrich","name":"Richard Gombrich","description":"Oxford Indologist and Buddhologist; supervised Mark Dyczkowski's doctorate.","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2149600"],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/da/Richard_Gombrich_a_pordenonelegge.jpg","birthDate":"1937","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/tantra-studies"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"},"knows":[{"@type":"Role","roleName":"academic_supervisor_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/mark-dyczkowski"}},{"@type":"Role","roleName":"academic_supervisor_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/steven-collins"}},{"@type":"Role","roleName":"academic_supervisor_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/alexander-wynne"}}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/robert-goldman","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/robert-goldman","name":"Robert P. Goldman","description":"UC Berkeley Sanskritist; co-chair of Christopher Wallis's dissertation committee.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/tantra-studies"}],"knows":[{"@type":"Role","roleName":"academic_supervisor_of","knows":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/christopher-wallis"}}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/sadhguru","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/sadhguru","name":"Sadhguru (Jaggi Vasudev)","description":"Founder of the Isha Foundation; consecrated the Linga Bhairavi goddess form at Coimbatore and teaches Bhairavi Sadhana as a devotional practice open to lay people.","birthDate":"1957","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/shakta"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/sally-kempton","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/sally-kempton","name":"Sally Kempton","description":"Journalist turned monastic in Swami Muktananda's Siddha Yoga (met Muktananda in 1974; initiated as Swami Durgananda in 1982); later an independent teacher of meditation, Kashmir Shaivism and goddess practice (Awakening Shakti, Meditation for the Love of It).","birthDate":"1943","deathDate":"2023","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/seth-powell","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/seth-powell","name":"Seth Powell","description":"Historian of yoga and founder of the Yogic Studies platform and podcast.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/hatha"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/shaman-hatley","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/shaman-hatley","name":"Shaman Hatley","description":"Scholar of early tantric Śaivism and yoginī cults (UMass Boston); editor of the Brahmayāmala.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kaula"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/shambhavi-sarasvati","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/shambhavi-sarasvati","name":"Shambhavi Sarasvati","description":"Spiritual director of Jaya Kula in Portland, Oregon, teaching Trika Shaivism alongside Tibetan Dzogchen; Anandamayi Ma is her root guru.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/sivaya-subramuniyaswami","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/sivaya-subramuniyaswami","name":"Satguru Sivaya Subramuniyaswami (Gurudeva)","description":"American-born founder of Kauai's Hindu Monastery and Himalayan Academy, initiated by Yogaswami of Jaffna; author of Dancing with Siva and Merging with Siva.","birthDate":"1927","deathDate":"2001","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/shaiva-siddhanta"}],"knows":[{"@type":"