ern adaptation of Chöd.","birthDate":"1947","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/nyingma"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/chozen-bays","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/chozen-bays","name":"Jan Chozen Bays","description":"Jan Chozen Bays, Dharma heir of Taizan Maezumi, paediatrician and co-abbot of Great Vow Zen Monastery in Oregon.","birthDate":"1945","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/soto-zen"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/meian-elbert","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/meian-elbert","name":"Rev. Meian Elbert","description":"Abbess of Shasta Abbey in the Order of Buddhist Contemplatives founded by Houn Jiyu-Kennett.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/soto-zen"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/jiryu-rutschman-byler","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/jiryu-rutschman-byler","name":"Jiryu Rutschman-Byler","description":"Soto Zen priest and former abbot of Green Gulch Farm, San Francisco Zen Center.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/soto-zen"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/anam-thubten","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/anam-thubten","name":"Anam Thubten","description":"Tibetan teacher trained in the Nyingma tradition who leads the Dharmata Foundation in California and teaches a direct, non-sectarian approach to awakening.","birthDate":"1968","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/nyingma"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/phakchok-rinpoche","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/phakchok-rinpoche","name":"Phakchok Rinpoche","description":"Nyingma and Kagyu lineage holder, grandson of Tulku Urgyen Rinpoche, abbot of Ka-Nying Shedrub Ling and founder of the Samye Institute.","birthDate":"1981","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/nyingma"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/guo-gu