/beth-upton","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/beth-upton","name":"Beth Upton","description":"English meditation teacher; ordained as a nun at Pa-Auk in Myanmar in 2008 and trained five years under Pa-Auk Sayadaw, disrobing in 2018. Teaches the Pa-Auk samatha-vipassanā system one to one and online, on a donation basis, with short video lessons on every stage.","birthDate":"1982","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/pa-auk"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/sugatavamsa","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/sugatavamsa","name":"Ven. Sugatavaṃsa","alternateName":"Sugatavaṃsa","description":"Theravāda monk who teaches the Abhidhamma and Pāli courses at Pa-Auk Meditation Centre Singapore, including a full English course on dependent origination (2022, repeated 2025).","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/pa-auk"}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/r-ramanand","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/person/r-ramanand","name":"Dr R. Ramanand","alternateName":"R. Ramanand","description":"Indian scholar of tantra and Kashmir Śaivism linked with the Abhinavagupta Institute of Advanced Studies; gave four public lectures on the fundamental tenets of Kashmir Śaivism at Sree Krishna College, Guruvayur, in January 2023.","knowsAbout":[{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kashmir-shaivism"}],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"Scholar"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/buddhism","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/buddhism","name":"Buddhism","description":"The path of the Buddha: seeing suffering, its cause in craving, and its ending, through virtue, meditation and wisdom.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"buddhism","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q748"]},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/theravada","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/theravada","name":"Theravāda","description":"The oldest surviving Buddhist school, rooted in the Pāli discourses and the monastic code; strong today in Sri Lanka and Southeast Asia.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"theravada","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q132265"],"broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/buddhism"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/early-suttas","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/early-suttas","name":"Early suttas","description":"Practice read straight from the early discourses, outside the commentarial mainstream; Hillside Hermitage belongs here, drawing on Ñāṇavīra Thera.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"early-suttas","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3073049"],"broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/theravada"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/thai-forest","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/thai-forest","name":"Thai Forest","description":"The forest monastic lineage of Ajahn Mun and Ajahn Chah.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"thai-forest","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1473142"],"broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/theravada"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/insight","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/insight","name":"Insight meditation","description":"The modern vipassanā movement and its Western retreat centres.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"insight","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17015142"],"broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/theravada"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/mahayana","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/mahayana","name":"Mahāyāna","description":"The \"great vehicle\": the bodhisattva ideal of awakening for the sake of all beings, and the teaching of emptiness.","inDefinedTermSet":"