rfection)","description":"Teaching and practice lineage, not a separate institution; also held in Bön and taught across Rimé.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"dzogchen","broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/nyingma"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/karma-kagyu","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/karma-kagyu","name":"Karma Kagyu","description":"Largest Kagyu branch, led by the Karmapas.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"karma-kagyu","broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kagyu"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/drikung-kagyu","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/drikung-kagyu","name":"Drikung Kagyu","description":"Founded by Jigten Sumgön.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"drikung-kagyu","broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kagyu"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/drukpa-kagyu","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/drukpa-kagyu","name":"Drukpa Kagyu","description":"State tradition of Bhutan.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"drukpa-kagyu","broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kagyu"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/shangpa-kagyu","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/shangpa-kagyu","name":"Shangpa Kagyu","description":"Separate lineage from Niguma and Sukhasiddhi, revived by Kalu Rinpoche.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"shangpa-kagyu","broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/kagyu"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/mahamudra","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/mahamudra","name":"Mahamudra (the Great Seal)","description":"Practice lineage at the heart of Kagyu, also taught in Gelug.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCo