ith covens, the Goddess and God and the wheel of the year.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"wicca","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q59774"],"broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/modern-paganism"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/heathenry","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/heathenry","name":"Heathenry","description":"Modern revival of pre-Christian Germanic and Norse religion (Asatru, Odinism).","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"heathenry","broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/modern-paganism"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/goddess-spirituality","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/goddess-spirituality","name":"Goddess spirituality","description":"Devotion to the divine feminine as Goddess, centred in the UK on Glastonbury.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"goddess-spirituality","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3866624"],"broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/modern-paganism"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/golden-dawn","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/golden-dawn","name":"Hermetic Order of the Golden Dawn","description":"Initiatory order founded in London in 1888 that shaped modern Western magic.","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"golden-dawn","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q368173"],"broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/western-magic"}},{"@type":"DefinedTerm","@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/thelema","url":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/thelema","name":"Thelema","description":"Aleister Crowley's religious and magical system (\"Do what thou wilt\").","inDefinedTermSet":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/tradition/","termCode":"thelema","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q745955"],"broader":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/