ta turns the question around: find who it is that is afraid."},{"@type":"Syllabus","name":"The moment of death and after","description":"Tibetan teachers map the dying process and the bardo in detail."},{"@type":"Syllabus","name":"Grief and loss","description":"Death is also what happens to the people we love."},{"@type":"Syllabus","name":"Practising dying","description":"Plato called philosophy a rehearsal for death."},{"@type":"Syllabus","name":"What remains","description":"End where the traditions point: the deathless, the Self, the open sky of mind."}],"hasPart":{"@type":"ItemList","itemListOrder":"https://schema.org/ItemListOrderAscending","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/clip/BZZupDuprhU@84"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/practice/the-five-remembrances"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/collection/seven-days-with-death"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/clip/cY2GjcIBKkw"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":5,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/practice/mindfulness-of-death-maranasati"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":6,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/clip/nIZrBtSdshM"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":7,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/practice/self-enquiry-who-dies"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":8,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/clip/QRoCECSai5A"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":9,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/topic/rebirth"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":10,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/clip/S4LhQNsrI5A"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":11,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/practice/goodwill-metta"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":12,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/clip/OwCvbSiRkM8"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":13,"item":{"@id":"https://tantrafiles.xyz/practice/practising-dying-melete-thanatou"}},{"@type":"ListItem","positio